        "category": "summary",
        "text": "Security update for the Linux Kernel (Live Patch 1 for SLE 15 SP7)",
        "title": "Title of the patch"
      },
      {
        "category": "description",
        "text": "This update for the Linux Kernel 6.4.0-150700_53_3 fixes several issues.\n\nThe following security issues were fixed:\n\n- CVE-2025-38494: HID: core: do not bypass hid_hw_raw_request (bsc#1247350).\n- CVE-2025-38495: HID: core: ensure the allocated report buffer can contain the reserved report ID (bsc#1247351).\n- CVE-2025-38083: net_sched: prio: fix a race in prio_tune() (bsc#1245350).\n- CVE-2025-37752: net_sched: sch_sfq: move the limit validation (bsc#1245776).\n",
        "title": "Description of the patch"
      },
